{
 "_comment": {
  "about": "2.582.0 Fibo 2.0 Edit Turbo (Bria, 8B, CC BY-NC 4.0 - non-commercial; ComfyUI's native Fibo 2.0 support from 21 Oct 2026: CLIPLoader type fibo2 + TextEncodeFibo2). The layout of the realrebelai/Fibo-2.0_GGUFs workflow: UNETLoader -> KSampler (4 steps, cfg 1, euler / simple - it is distilled for edits, a negative does nothing) <- TextEncodeFibo2 (positive 0 / negative 1 / latent 2). Up to 4 pictures, LoadImage 21..24 = images.image_1..4 = <image_1>..<image_4> in the prompt (image_1 = the picture being edited); unused slots are removed by scripts/comfy_image.apply_images. Low VRAM: the w4a8 ConvRot file (6.6 GB, Comfy Kitchen) or the GGUF Q4_0 (6.6 GB, ComfyUI-GGUF) with the int8 Qwen3-VL 4B text encoder."
 },
 "1": {
  "class_type": "UNETLoader",
  "inputs": {
   "unet_name": "fibo2_edit_turbo_w4a8_convrot.safetensors",
   "weight_dtype": "default"
  },
  "_meta": {
   "title": "Fibo 2.0 model (a .gguf here becomes UnetLoaderGGUF - scripts/comfy_image.match_loader)"
  }
 },
 "2": {
  "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
  "inputs": {
   "clip_name": "qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors",
   "type": "fibo2",
   "device": "default"
  },
  "_meta": {
   "title": "Qwen3-VL 4B (type fibo2)"
  }
 },
 "3": {
  "class_type": "VAELoader",
  "inputs": {
   "vae_name": "flux2-vae.safetensors"
  },
  "_meta": {
   "title": "FLUX.2 VAE"
  }
 },
 "9": {
